WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.480
The same document, at two addresses.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.960
One of them is yours.

00:00:07.634 --> 00:00:09.882
Here's how a team works on Markdrop.

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:12.342
Create a workspace for your team.

00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:14.662
A short checklist walks you through the rest.

00:00:16.614 --> 00:00:18.814
File documents and uploads into folders.

00:00:19.594 --> 00:00:21.314
Drop files straight onto a folder.

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:27.173
Invite people by email, as Can view, Can edit or Admin.

00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:29.513
Nobody joins until they accept.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:34.902
Choose how private the workspace is: Open, Team, or Locked.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:39.177
Then Preview as shows a folder the way an outsider would see it.

00:00:41.639 --> 00:00:45.060
Add your own domain, like docs.acme.com.

00:00:45.261 --> 00:00:50.161
Markdrop shows the two DNS records to add, and tells you where your DNS lives.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.417
Add them, choose Check DNS, and it goes live.

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:59.914
Folders become part of each address, and your markdrop.in links keep working.

00:01:02.013 --> 00:01:04.573
Add your logo and accent colour.

00:01:04.593 --> 00:01:09.653
Pages and link previews on your domain carry your brand, and you can leave our name off the cards.

00:01:11.742 --> 00:01:14.374
Set up your workspace at markdrop.in.
